config KSCAN_GMK70_WIRED
    bool "GMK70 wired universal-role 10x9 matrix"
    depends on KSCAN && SOC_WB32FQ95
    default y if DT_HAS_ZUOYA_GMK70_WIRED_ENABLED
    help
      Native five-row local scan and Vial-compatible UART1 split transport.
      Right physical rows are delivered as logical rows 5..9. No radio support.
